"opaquely, or blended in different ways with the background colors and patterns."
"<p> KDE allows you to have the wallpaper change automatically at specified "
"intervals of timẹ You can also replace the background with a program that "
"updates the desktop dynamicallỵ For example, the \"kdeworld\" program shows a "
"day/night map of the world which is updated periodicallỵ"

